ranty: 1 Year (Service Warranty)</li>\n              </ul>\n</div>\n\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"block-footer\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#\">View Details</a></div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n                    </div>\n</div>\n\n                  </div>\n                              </div>\n            </div>\n                  </div>\n                      </div>\n      </div>\n\n                                </div>\n                                                </div>","blocksHtml":"<div class=\"product-blocks blocks-default\">\n            <div class=\"product-blocks-default product-blocks-416 grid-rows\">\n          <div class=\"grid-row grid-row-416-1\">\n                <div class=\"grid-cols\">\n                      <div class=\"grid-col grid-col-416-1-1\">\n              <div class=\"grid-items\">\n                                  <div class=\"grid-item grid-item-416-1-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"module module-blocks module-blocks-417 blocks-tabs\">\n    <div class=\"module-body\">\n                <div class=\"tabs-container\">\n      <ul class=\"nav nav-tabs\">\n                  <li class=\"tab-2 active\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Description</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-4\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Product Table</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-5\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-3\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Video</a>\n                      </li>\n                  <li class=\"tab-6\">\n                          <a href=\"#blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-4\" data-toggle=\"tab\">Review</a>\n                      </li>\n              </ul>\n      <div class=\"tab-content\">\n                              <div class=\"module-item module-item-2 tab-pane active\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-1\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-description\">\n                <h2><b>Juniper MX80 Universal Routing Platform | High-Performance, Scalable &amp; Space-Saving Router</b></h2><div>Compact &amp; Powerful Routing for Enterprises &amp; Service Providers</div><div>The&nbsp;<a href=\"/networking/ethernet-router/juniper-mx80-universal-router\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Juniper MX80</a> Universal Routing Platform is a high-performance, compact, and feature-rich router, ideal for enterprise WAN, Data Center Interconnect (DCI), branch aggregation, and campus networking. Designed to operate in space- and power-constrained environments, the MX80 delivers unmatched scalability, agility, and cost efficiency.</div><div><br></div><div>With 80 Gbps throughput, four built-in 10GbE ports, two Modular Interface Card (MIC) slots, and an additional MS-MIC slot for dedicated service support, the MX80 ensures flexible network connectivity and seamless expansion as business demands grow.</div><div><br></div><div>80-Gbps Switching Capacity – Ultra-fast performance for high-bandwidth networks</div><div>4 x 10GbE Ports – High-speed connectivity for enterprise &amp; service provider applications</div><div>2 Modular Interface Card (MIC) Slots – Flexible network expansion options</div><div>MS-MIC Slot for Dedicated Services – Optimized for advanced network functions</div><div>Space &amp; Power Efficient – Compact 2RU design, ideal for constrained environments</div><div><br></div><h3><b>Key Features &amp; Benefits</b></h3><ul><li>Ultra-Fast Performance – 80 Gbps capacity for high-speed data transfer</li><li>Flexible Connectivity – 4 x 10GbE ports + 2 MIC slots for scalable networking</li><li>Modular Design for Growth – Pay-as-you-grow expansion to meet evolving demands</li><li>Space-Efficient 2RU Form Factor – Perfect for power- and space-limited deployment